[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5821.43, "timestamp": "01:37:01", "text": "なし。雨をありがとう。私はしません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5823.35, "timestamp": "01:37:03", "text": "あなたがまだここにいるかどうかを知るために、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5826.87, "timestamp": "01:37:06", "text": "雨のために。遅れてしまって本当にごめんなさい。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5827.461, "timestamp": "01:37:07", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "my question is, which viewer would care to that level that they NEED to know exactly for what reason you're brb-ing and what kind of a task it is"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5830.39, "timestamp": "01:37:10", "text": "どれくらい時間がかかった？えっと、30分。ええ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5833.189, "timestamp": "01:37:13", "text": "「うん、30分でいいよね？」って言っただけだよね？の"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5839.114, "timestamp": "01:37:19", "author": "@Dragnozer", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/S76Kh7cHFwpQNz9yjhQC88CHN2CaFRgcX6E1lcl7bEXBNP_DPdf1iSETHK2qlrHYkwo6BbPw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "THAT WAS A VOD?, i thought that was you playing 😆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5842.39, "timestamp": "01:37:22", "text": "午後。私の質問はどちらの方向か"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5844.39, "timestamp": "01:37:24", "text": "そのレベルを気にする必要があるだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5846.07, "timestamp": "01:37:26", "text": "理由がない限り、そうである必要はない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5847.91, "timestamp": "01:37:27", "text": "あなたはどのような仕事をしているのか、そしてそれはどのような種類の仕事なのか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5851.31, "timestamp": "01:37:31", "text": "は？それは、私はあなただと思った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5856.149, "timestamp": "01:37:36", "text": "プレイ中。ああ、なんてことだ。どうすればいいですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5858.229, "timestamp": "01:37:38", "text": "人々が私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5861.669, "timestamp": "01:37:41", "text": "そこにはなく、V字型です。視覚的にも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5864.95, "timestamp": "01:37:44", "text": "ウィ